{"4858490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Real backrooms", "steam_appid": 4858490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the Backrooms and try to escape this endless hell. Traverse new, never-before-seen levels and confront the horrors lurking within. Will you be ready to face the fear and dangers of the Backrooms?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/f51923c9343734160282bd8a9c16ce16.webp?t=1787681349\" width=382 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover an experience where you choose your level of realism! Each level is optimized to offer a unique immersion, with enhanced realism and constant pressure at every moment. Explore the Backrooms like never before and tailor your experience to the challenge you want to take on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.poster.avif?t=1787681349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.webm?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.mp4?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/3166666f53983f4241538dafe3932133.webp?t=1787681349\" width=332 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cooperative multiplayer mode for up to 4 players for an even more fun and terrifying experience! Your teammates will be the only ones standing between you and the madness. Escape the levels together and make sure no one is left behind. Here, there are no losses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/898ff33fbdf8fd3d030bf6058b4360a7.poster.avif?t=1787681349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/898ff33fbdf8fd3d030bf6058b4360a7.webm?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/898ff33fbdf8fd3d030bf6058b4360a7.mp4?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/e33f99fc044a1c17da52c1a561621e96.webp?t=1787681349\" width=221 height=62 /></span><br><br>Discover hidden levels with your friends! Depending on the path you choose, your fate will be different. Choose your route wisely, because many paths lead to certain death. Explore, make the right decisions, and find the exit before it's too late.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the Backrooms and try to escape this endless hell. Traverse new, never-before-seen levels and confront the horrors lurking within. Will you be ready to face the fear and dangers of the Backrooms?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/f51923c9343734160282bd8a9c16ce16.webp?t=1787681349\" width=382 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover an experience where you choose your level of realism! Each level is optimized to offer a unique immersion, with enhanced realism and constant pressure at every moment. Explore the Backrooms like never before and tailor your experience to the challenge you want to take on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.poster.avif?t=1787681349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.webm?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/dcee70c6269ced7f3017954efff24a58.mp4?t=1787681349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/3166666f53983f4241538dafe3932133.webp?t=1787681349\" width=332 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cooperative multiplayer mode for up to 4 players for an even more fun and terrifying experience! Your teammates will be the only ones standing between you and the madness. Escape the levels together and make sure no one is left behind. Here, there are no losses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858490/extras/898ff33fbdf8fd3d030bf6058b4360a